===Etymology===
From {{etyl|urj-pro|fi}} {{m|urj-pro|*juma||sky, god}}. Related to Estonian {{m|et|jumal}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈjumɑlɑ]}}
* {{rhymes|lang=fi|umɑlɑ}}
* {{hyphenation|ju|ma|la|lang=fi}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# A [[god]].
# A [[deity]] ''(god)''.

